  "metadata": {
    "method": "Climate Watch reports CH4 in MtCO2e using an AR4 100-year GWP of 25; we divide by 25 to recover an implied raw CH4 tonnage comparable to Climate TRACE's native CH4 figures. Climate TRACE uses a satellite-observation-informed, largely bottom-up per-source methodology; Climate Watch's figure is a modelled, gap-filled reconstruction (CAIT/PIK lineage), not a line-by-line transcription of India's own UNFCCC submissions. Waste has no Climate Watch equivalent sector for India, so no gap series exists for it here — see the sparse official BUR anchors for that sector instead.",
